{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00375",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 7.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "So, hi, I'm glad you could make it. Sorry about the wait, we're running a bit behind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.09,
      "end_seconds": 14.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Oh, that's fine. I was just reading something on my phone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.64,
      "end_seconds": 17.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.7,
      "end_seconds": 27.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "So, you know, I've been forgetting things lately, doctor. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.84,
      "end_seconds": 32.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "And when did that start? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.73,
      "end_seconds": 42.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.91,
      "text": "It's been going on for nearly five years. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I've also been repeating the same questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.75,
      "end_seconds": 45.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "So, have you been misplacing things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.55,
      "end_seconds": 50.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Oh, yes, about the same, about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.63,
      "end_seconds": 54.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "So, do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.31,
      "end_seconds": 68.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.38,
      "end_seconds": 74.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any falls, low mood or hallucinations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.47,
      "end_seconds": 79.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Um, no falls, low mood or hallucinations, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.23,
      "end_seconds": 83.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "And weakness on one side, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.88,
      "end_seconds": 86.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No. No weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.88,
      "end_seconds": 88.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.43,
      "end_seconds": 90.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.75,
      "end_seconds": 106.63,
      "duration_seconds": 14.88,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.24,
      "end_seconds": 109.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.25,
      "end_seconds": 112.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.93,
      "end_seconds": 117.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I mean, I had a hysterectomy about twelve years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.83,
      "end_seconds": 130.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.9,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.04,
      "end_seconds": 134.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.92,
      "end_seconds": 141.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.56,
      "end_seconds": 148.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.53,
      "end_seconds": 151.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.57,
      "end_seconds": 152.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.21,
      "end_seconds": 159.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.48,
      "end_seconds": 162.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.93,
      "end_seconds": 168.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.94,
      "end_seconds": 171.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.32,
      "end_seconds": 178.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.09,
      "end_seconds": 185.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "I've, I've had diabetes for five years now. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.67,
      "end_seconds": 198.67,
      "duration_seconds": 12.0,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.98,
      "end_seconds": 201.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Uh, that's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.94,
      "end_seconds": 206.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.15,
      "end_seconds": 210.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Okay, so my uncle had colon cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.66,
      "end_seconds": 214.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.02,
      "end_seconds": 217.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Okay, so of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.4,
      "end_seconds": 227.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.88,
      "end_seconds": 232.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.54,
      "end_seconds": 233.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.17,
      "end_seconds": 243.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.77,
      "end_seconds": 248.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.61,
      "end_seconds": 252.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.73,
      "end_seconds": 266.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Your gait is steady and the tone in your limbs is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.54,
      "end_seconds": 283.21,
      "duration_seconds": 11.67,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.72,
      "end_seconds": 285.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.53,
      "end_seconds": 308.47,
      "duration_seconds": 21.94,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, this looks most like memory difficulties that need to be worked up. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a vitamin deficiency yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been forgetting things lately for nearly five years, and no hallucinations or weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.8,
      "end_seconds": 311.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Uh, exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.06,
      "end_seconds": 314.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.56,
      "end_seconds": 317.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.97,
      "end_seconds": 343.19,
      "duration_seconds": 24.22,
      "text": "Let's get a vitamin B12 level, for memory loss. Let's get blood tests, for memory loss. Keep a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.86,
      "end_seconds": 347.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.86,
      "end_seconds": 352.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.51,
      "end_seconds": 359.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.75,
      "end_seconds": 368.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.56,
      "end_seconds": 374.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.31,
      "end_seconds": 377.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}